### Marketplace - Create Order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-123",
  "storeProfileId": "store-456",
  "subtotal": 100.00,
  "shippingCost": 10.00,
  "tax": 8.00,
  "totalAmount": 118.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

